  "goodToKnow": "Bedingungslos means unconditional: bedingungslose Liebe, bedingungsloses Vertrauen. Das bedingungslose Grundeinkommen (BGE) is universal basic income, widely debated in Germany; a long-term study by the association Mein Grundeinkommen paid selected people 1,200 euros a month for three years. Historically, Germany's bedingungslose Kapitulation on 8 May 1945 ended WWII in Europe."
